# Paths use BACKSLASHES -- that is what the WoW client's .toc parser expects
# for subdirectories, on every platform (Wine translates them).
#
# Load order matters: Init.lua creates the shared `ns` namespace that every
# other file reads from, so it comes first. The Data files are pure tables
# with no dependencies. Tabs register themselves into ns.tabs, so they must
# load before Core.lua builds the main frame from that registry.

Data\Echoes.lua
Data\Tomes.lua

Init.lua
Widgets.lua
DB.lua
Util.lua

Ownership.lua
Debug.lua
ImportExport.lua

Wishlists.lua
Tabs\Tab_Browse.lua
Tabs\Tab_MissingTomes.lua
Tabs\Tab_CurrentBuild.lua

Core.lua
